  "summary": "Official Qwen FP8 weights on one Intel Arc Pro B70. Recommended: MTP depth 5 with a draft-only INT4 shortlist head and a single-checkpoint recurrent state, 32,768 tokens of context, 54.1 tok/s writing speed; outputs identical to no MTP. A max-context profile reaches 40,960 tokens at 54.3 tok/s, and a no-quantization profile (52.4 tok/s, 28,672 tokens) drafts with an FP16 copy of the output layer instead of an INT4 one. Since September 18 the image also computes the draft verifier's attention rows in one pass, which leaves short prompts as they were and writes 9-17% faster after prompts above 16,384 tokens.",
